1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,460
Pillar one: transpiration pull.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:10,208
In the leaf, water evaporates from the wet walls of the mesophyll cells and diffuses out through the stomata.

3
00:00:10,208 --> 00:00:17,447
Each evaporating surface tugs on the water behind it, and that tug reaches all the way down the xylem.

